      "updated": 1790594991968,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- RAG Engine\n\nA production-oriented Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) engine built with FastAPI and PostgreSQL.\n\nThe system provides a complete document-to-answer pipeline, including document processing, text chunking,\n embedding generation, hybrid retrieval, and LLM-based response generation.\n\nThe retrieval layer combines semantic vector search with lexical search to improve document retrieval across different types of queries.\n Retrieved results can then be ranked and filtered before being provided to the language model as contextual information.\n\n2- Key Features\n\n* Document and asset management\n* Topic-based document organization\n* Configurable text processing and chunking\n* Vector embeddings with PostgreSQL `pgvector`\n* Lexical search using PostgreSQL `tsvector`\n* Hybrid retrieval\n* Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF)\n* Reranking support\n* Arabic and English text processing\n* LLM-powered answer generation\n* RAG evaluation and testing\n* Async database operations\n* Docker-based deployment\n\n3- Architecture\n\nThe system is designed as a modular pipeline:\n\n**Document → Processing → Chunking → Embedding → Retrieval → Reranking → LLM → Answer**\n\nThe project is structured to allow individual components of the RAG pipeline to be replaced or extended without redesigning the entire system.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- RAG Engine\n\nA production-oriented Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) engine built with FastAPI and PostgreSQL.\n\nThe system provides a complete document-to-answer pipeline, including document processing, text chunking,\n embedding generation, hybrid retrieval, and LLM-based response generation.\n\nThe retrieval layer combines semantic vector search with lexical search to improve document retrieval across different types of queries.\n Retrieved results can then be ranked and filtered before being provided to the language model as contextual information.\n\n2- Key Features\n\n* Document and asset management\n* Topic-based document organization\n* Configurable text processing and chunking\n* Vector embeddings with PostgreSQL `pgvector`\n* Lexical search using PostgreSQL `tsvector`\n* Hybrid retrieval\n* Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF)\n* Reranking support\n* Arabic and English text processing\n* LLM-powered answer generation\n* RAG evaluation and testing\n* Async database operations\n* Docker-based deployment\n\n3- Architecture\n\nThe system is designed as a modular pipeline:\n\n**Document → Processing → Chunking → Embedding → Retrieval → Reranking → LLM → Answer**\n\nThe project is structured to allow individual components of the RAG pipeline to be replaced or extended without redesigning the entire system.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
