      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "#Architecture\n\nThe application is organized into several main layers:\n\n* **Routes**: Defines the API endpoints and request/response schemas.\n* **Controllers**: Handles application logic and coordinates the different components of the system.\n* **Models**: Contains the core data models and database-related logic.\n* **Database**: Handles PostgreSQL schemas and Alembic migrations.\n* **Stores**: Provides abstractions and implementations for embedding models and LLM providers.\n* **Settings**: Manages application configuration.\n* **Assets**: Contains the documents processed by the RAG pipeline.\n\n### High-Level Flow\n\n\nClient\n   │\n   ▼\nRoutes\n   │\n   ▼\nControllers\n   │\n   ├───────────────┐\n   ▼                          ▼\nModels                    Stores\n   │                          ├── Embeddings\n   │                          └── LLM\n   │\n   ▼\nDatabase\n   │\n   ▼\nPostgreSQL\n\nThe architecture uses interfaces and factories for AI providers,\n allowing embedding models and LLM providers to be changed or extended\n without modifying the components that consume them.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "#Architecture\n\nThe application is organized into several main layers:\n\n* **Routes**: Defines the API endpoints and request/response schemas.\n* **Controllers**: Handles application logic and coordinates the different components of the system.\n* **Models**: Contains the core data models and database-related logic.\n* **Database**: Handles PostgreSQL schemas and Alembic migrations.\n* **Stores**: Provides abstractions and implementations for embedding models and LLM providers.\n* **Settings**: Manages application configuration.\n* **Assets**: Contains the documents processed by the RAG pipeline.\n\n### High-Level Flow\n\n\nClient\n   │\n   ▼\nRoutes\n   │\n   ▼\nControllers\n   │\n   ├───────────────┐\n   ▼                          ▼\nModels                    Stores\n   │                          ├── Embeddings\n   │                          └── LLM\n   │\n   ▼\nDatabase\n   │\n   ▼\nPostgreSQL\n\nThe architecture uses interfaces and factories for AI providers,\n allowing embedding models and LLM providers to be changed or extended\n without modifying the components that consume them.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
