      "text": "## RAG Pipeline\n\n\nDocument\n   │\n   ▼\nData Processing\n   │\n   ▼\nNLP Processing\n   │\n   ▼\nChunking\n   │\n   ├───────────────┐\n   ▼                          ▼\nEmbedding         Lexical Processing\n   │                           │\n   ▼                          ▼\npgvector                 PostgreSQL  \n    │                          │\n    └───────┬───────┘\n                 ▼\n          Hybrid Retrieval\n                 │\n                 ▼\n                LLM\n                 │\n                 ▼\n             Response",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## RAG Pipeline\n\n\nDocument\n   │\n   ▼\nData Processing\n   │\n   ▼\nNLP Processing\n   │\n   ▼\nChunking\n   │\n   ├───────────────┐\n   ▼                          ▼\nEmbedding         Lexical Processing\n   │                           │\n   ▼                          ▼\npgvector                 PostgreSQL  \n    │                          │\n    └───────┬───────┘\n                 ▼\n          Hybrid Retrieval\n                 │\n                 ▼\n                LLM\n                 │\n                 ▼\n             Response",
